{"at":"2026-10-05T12:52:06.426Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"MDN官方规范明确Service Worker仅在安全上下文（HTTPS或http://localhost）中可用，file://与普通HTTP不支持注册运行Service Worker，纯前端离线重启需依赖该安全上下文。","content":"Service workers are only available in secure contexts : this means that their document is served over HTTPS, although browsers also treat http://localhost as a secure context, to facilitate local development.","scope":"deployment.security_context_and_offline","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Service_Worker_API"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording evidence for Service Worker API","toolSummary":"Record Service Worker evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":87,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T12:52:06.532Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"MDN官方规范明确sessionStorage生命周期仅绑定于当前浏览器标签页或窗口（page session），页面刷新可保留，但关闭标签页或窗口即被清除，且跨标签页不共享；草稿暂存不能承诺跨窗口关闭必能恢复。","content":"sessionStorage is partitioned by both origin and browser tabs (top-level browsing contexts). The data in sessionStorage is only kept for the duration of the page session. A page session lasts as long as the tab or the browser is open, and survives over page reloads and restores. Closing the tab/window ends the session and clears data in sessionStorage.","scope":"technical.session_draft_lifecycle","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sessionStorage"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording evidence for sessionStorage","toolSummary":"Record sessionStorage evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":88,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T12:52:06.639Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"MDN官方规范明确KeyboardEvent.isComposing在输入法合成会话（compositionstart至compositionend）期间返回true，用于防止快捷键在用户输入中文/输入法组合时发生按键劫持。","content":"The KeyboardEvent.isComposing read-only property returns a boolean value indicating if the event is fired within a composition session, i.e., after compositionstart and before compositionend.","scope":"ui.shortcut_ime_composition_guard","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/KeyboardEvent/isComposing"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording evidence for KeyboardEvent isComposing","toolSummary":"Record isComposing evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":89,"imagePath":null}
